%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5fd28af06e0507248bbd442c49b581f1, type: 3}
  m_Name: CD_EditorTexts
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Modules.Localization.Shared::Modules.LocalizationModule.Shared.Data.UnityObjects.CD_LocalizationTable
  Usage: 1
  Texts:
  - Key: Dragging
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\xFCr\xFCkleme"
  - Key: Animate Jellies
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Animasyonu"
  - Key: 'Off: no wobble, stretch, pop or breathing, and their settings are hidden.
      Jellies still slide and lift smoothly.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kapal\u0131: titreme, esneme, z\u0131plama ve nefes alma olmaz, ayarlar\u0131
        da gizlenir. J\xF6leler yine yumu\u015Fak\xE7a kayar ve kalkar."
  - Key: Grid Drag
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "H\xFCcre H\xFCcre S\xFCr\xFCkle"
  - Key: 'On: a held jelly moves cell by cell. Off: it glides with the finger between
      cells.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\xE7\u0131k: tutulan j\xF6le h\xFCcre h\xFCcre ilerler. Kapal\u0131:
        h\xFCcreler aras\u0131nda parmakla birlikte kayar."
  - Key: Drag Follow
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Parma\u011F\u0131 Takip"
  - Key: How far a gliding jelly may lead its cell toward the finger, in cells. It
      never leads into a blocked cell.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kayan j\xF6lenin h\xFCcresinden parma\u011Fa do\u011Fru ne kadar \xF6nde
        gidebilece\u011Fi, h\xFCcre cinsinden. Kapal\u0131 bir h\xFCcreye asla girmez."
  - Key: Slide Speed
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kayma H\u0131z\u0131"
  - Key: How fast a jelly slides along its route, in cells per second. It never overshoots
      or cuts a corner.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6lenin yolunda ne kadar h\u0131zl\u0131 kayd\u0131\u011F\u0131,
        saniyede h\xFCcre. Asla hedefi ge\xE7mez, k\xF6\u015Fe kesmez."
  - Key: Lifting
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kald\u0131rma"
  - Key: Grab Lift
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tutma Y\xFCksekli\u011Fi"
  - Key: How high a held jelly rises, in cells.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tutulan j\xF6lenin ne kadar y\xFCkseldi\u011Fi, h\xFCcre cinsinden."
  - Key: Lift Time
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kalkma S\xFCresi"
  - Key: Seconds a jelly takes to rise or settle when it is lifted or put down.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6lenin kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131nca y\xFCkselmesi ya da b\u0131rak\u0131l\u0131nca
        oturmas\u0131 i\xE7in ge\xE7en saniye."
  - Key: Springs
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Yaylar
  - Key: Jelly Stiffness
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Sertli\u011Fi"
  - Key: How fast the shape springs back. Higher wobbles quicker.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u015Eeklin ne kadar h\u0131zl\u0131 eski haline d\xF6nd\xFC\u011F\xFC.
        Y\xFCksek de\u011Fer daha h\u0131zl\u0131 titrer."
  - Key: Jelly Damping
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le S\xF6n\xFCm\xFC"
  - Key: Lower keeps wobbling longer.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "D\xFC\u015F\xFCk de\u011Fer daha uzun titretir."
  - Key: Move Stretch
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Hareket Esnemesi
  - Key: Stretch per cell per second of speed.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Saniyede bir h\xFCcrelik h\u0131z ba\u015F\u0131na esneme."
  - Key: Max Stretch
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: En Fazla Esneme
  - Key: Pull Stretch
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xC7ekme Esnemesi"
  - Key: How much a held jelly stretches toward the finger when pulled further than
      it can follow.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tutulan j\xF6le, takip edebilece\u011Finden uza\u011Fa \xE7ekilince
        parma\u011Fa do\u011Fru ne kadar esner."
  - Key: Grab Pop
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tutma Z\u0131plamas\u0131"
  - Key: Spread when picked up, as a share of its size.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tutulunca ne kadar yay\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131, boyutuna oranla."
  - Key: Land Squash
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "B\u0131rakma Ezilmesi"
  - Key: Spread when put down.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "B\u0131rak\u0131l\u0131nca ne kadar yay\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131."
  - Key: Fuse Pop
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Birle\u015Fme Z\u0131plamas\u0131"
  - Key: Spread when two jellies fuse.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130ki j\xF6le birle\u015Fince ne kadar yay\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131."
  - Key: Neighbour Wobble
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kom\u015Fu Titremesi"
  - Key: How strongly jellies touching the moving one react. 0 = only the moving
      jelly wobbles.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Hareket eden j\xF6leye de\u011Fen j\xF6lelerin ne kadar tepki verdi\u011Fi.
        0 = yaln\u0131zca hareket eden titrer."
  - Key: Breath Amount
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Nefes Miktar\u0131"
  - Key: Idle breathing while nothing touches it.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey dokunmazken bo\u015Fta nefes alma."
  - Key: Breath Speed
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Nefes H\u0131z\u0131"
  - Key: Fuse hint
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Birle\u015Fme ipucu"
  - Key: Fuse Hint Glow
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130pucu Parlamas\u0131"
  - Key: How much brighter a jelly glows while the held one would fuse with it on
      release.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tutulan j\xF6le b\u0131rak\u0131l\u0131nca birle\u015Fecekse, o j\xF6lenin
        ne kadar parlad\u0131\u011F\u0131."
  - Key: Fuse Ready Lift
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130pucu Y\xFCksekli\u011Fi"
  - Key: How high a jelly the held one would fuse with is lifted, in cells. Equal
      to GrabLift lifts both to the same height.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tutulan j\xF6lenin birle\u015Fece\u011Fi j\xF6lenin ne kadar kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131,
        h\xFCcre cinsinden. Tutma Y\xFCksekli\u011Fi'ne e\u015Fitse ikisi ayn\u0131
        y\xFCksekli\u011Fe \xE7\u0131kar."
  - Key: Fuse Hint Pulse
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130pucu Nabz\u0131"
  - Key: How much it swells with each pulse, as a share of its size.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Her nab\u0131zda ne kadar \u015Fi\u015Fti\u011Fi, boyutuna oranla."
  - Key: Fuse Hint Speed
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130pucu H\u0131z\u0131"
  - Key: "Pulses per second times 2\u03C0."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Saniyedeki nab\u0131z say\u0131s\u0131 \xD7 2\u03C0."
  - Key: Delivery
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Teslim
  - Key: Door Enter Time
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131ya Giri\u015F S\xFCresi"
  - Key: Seconds a delivered jelly takes to slide into its door and vanish. It plays
      even with AnimateJellies off.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Teslim edilen j\xF6lenin kap\u0131s\u0131na kay\u0131p kaybolmas\u0131
        i\xE7in ge\xE7en saniye. J\xF6le Animasyonu kapal\u0131yken de oynar."
  - Key: Door Enter Squeeze
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131da Daralma"
  - Key: How much narrower it gets as it squeezes into the door, as a share of its
      width.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131dan s\u0131k\u0131\u015Farak ge\xE7erken ne kadar darald\u0131\u011F\u0131,
        geni\u015Fli\u011Fine oranla."
  - Key: View
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm"
  - Key: Sprite Tilt
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "E\u011Fim"
  - Key: 'Vertical squash of the flat board: 1 looks straight down, lower looks more
      from the side.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n dikeyde bas\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131: 1 tam yukar\u0131dan
        bakar, d\xFC\u015F\xFCk de\u011Fer daha yandan bakar."
  - Key: Sprite Jelly Depth
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Y\xFCksekli\u011Fi"
  - Key: Visible side height of blocks, in cells.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bloklar\u0131n g\xF6r\xFCnen yan y\xFCz y\xFCksekli\u011Fi, h\xFCcre
        cinsinden."
  - Key: Sprite Wall Depth
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Duvar Y\xFCksekli\u011Fi"
  - Key: Sprite Board Depth
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahta Kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
  - Key: Jelly art
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le g\xF6rseli"
  - Key: Jelly Sprite
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: A sprite with a 9-slice border keeps round corners at any size; one without
      is stretched.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "9-slice kenar\u0131 olan sprite her boyutta yuvarlak k\xF6\u015Felerini
        korur; olmayan esnetilir."
  - Key: Jelly Sprite Is Block
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Sprite'\u0131 Haz\u0131r Blok"
  - Key: 'On: the jelly sprite is a finished block - top, side and shine painted
      in. No side, shine or bridge is added, and the cells of one piece join edge
      to edge.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\xE7\u0131k: j\xF6le sprite'\u0131 bitmi\u015F bir bloktur; \xFCst,
        yan ve parlakl\u0131k \xE7izilidir. Yan, parlakl\u0131k ya da k\xF6pr\xFC
        eklenmez, bir par\xE7an\u0131n h\xFCcreleri kenar kenara birle\u015Fir."
  - Key: Jelly Sprite Offset
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Sprite Kaymas\u0131"
  - Key: Moves a jelly's picture off the centre of its cell, in cells (x right, y
      up). Use it to seat the art on the grid; the jelly's cell does not change.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le resmini h\xFCcresinin ortas\u0131ndan kayd\u0131r\u0131r, h\xFCcre
        cinsinden (x sa\u011Fa, y yukar\u0131). G\xF6rseli \u0131zgaraya oturtmak
        i\xE7in; j\xF6lenin h\xFCcresi de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
  - Key: Jelly Side Sprite
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Yan Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: Optional. Drawn darker under the top face; empty uses the jelly sprite.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130ste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131. \xDCst y\xFCz\xFCn alt\u0131nda daha
        koyu \xE7izilir; bo\u015Fsa j\xF6le sprite'\u0131 kullan\u0131l\u0131r."
  - Key: Jelly Highlight Sprite
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Parlakl\u0131k Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: Jelly Shadow Sprite
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le G\xF6lge Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: Jelly Width
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le Geni\u015Fli\u011Fi"
  - Key: Jelly width as a share of a cell.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le geni\u015Fli\u011Fi, bir h\xFCcreye oranla."
  - Key: Sprite Bridge Length
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xF6pr\xFC Uzunlu\u011Fu"
  - Key: Sprite Bridge Width
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xF6pr\xFC Geni\u015Fli\u011Fi"
  - Key: Board art
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahta g\xF6rseli"
  - Key: Tile Sprite
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Zemin Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: Floor tile. A painted tile is drawn as it is; with TileSpriteAlt the two
      alternate as a checkerboard.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Zemin karosu. \xC7izilmi\u015F karo oldu\u011Fu gibi \xE7izilir; Alternatif
        Zemin ile ikisi dama tahtas\u0131 gibi s\u0131rayla gelir."
  - Key: Tile Sprite Alt
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Alternatif Zemin Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: Wall Skin
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Duvar G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFC"
  - Key: 'The wall round the board, the walls on it and the doors: a sprite for every
      straight side, corner, wall join and door width.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n \xE7evresindeki duvar, tahtadaki duvarlar ve kap\u0131lar:
        her d\xFCz kenar, k\xF6\u015Fe, duvar birle\u015Fimi ve kap\u0131 geni\u015Fli\u011Fi
        i\xE7in bir sprite."
  - Key: Wall Sprite
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Duvar Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: The generated wall and door block, used wherever WallSkin leaves a slot
      empty.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Duvar G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFC'nde bo\u015F kalan her yerde kullan\u0131lan
        \xFCretilmi\u015F duvar ve kap\u0131 blo\u011Fu."
  - Key: Board Sprite
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahta Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: Background Sprite
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Arka Plan Sprite'\u0131"
  - Key: Sprite Tile Size
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Zemin Karosu Boyutu
  - Key: Sizes as a fraction of one cell.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Boyutlar, bir h\xFCcreye oranla."
  - Key: Sprite Wall Size
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Duvar Boyutu
  - Key: Shading
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "G\xF6lgelendirme"
  - Key: Sprite Corner Radius
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xF6\u015Fe Yuvarlakl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
  - Key: Corner radius of 9-sliced sprites, as a share of the block.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "9-slice sprite'lar\u0131n k\xF6\u015Fe yar\u0131\xE7ap\u0131, blo\u011Fa
        oranla."
  - Key: Sprite Side Darken
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yan Y\xFCz Koyulu\u011Fu"
  - Key: How much darker a block's side is than its top.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Blo\u011Fun yan y\xFCz\xFCn\xFCn \xFCst\xFCnden ne kadar koyu oldu\u011Fu."
  - Key: Sprite Highlight
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Parlakl\u0131k"
  - Key: Sprite Shadow
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "G\xF6lge"
  - Key: Sprite Shadow Offset
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "G\xF6lge Kaymas\u0131"
  - Key: Shadow offset from a block's footprint, in cells.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "G\xF6lgenin blo\u011Fun oturdu\u011Fu yerden kaymas\u0131, h\xFCcre
        cinsinden."
  - Key: Colours
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Renkler
  - Key: Palette
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Palet
  - Key: The jelly colours. Their tints are edited right here, and the level editor
      and the game read the same palette.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le renkleri. Tonlar\u0131 tam burada d\xFCzenlenir; level edit\xF6r\xFC
        ve oyun ayn\u0131 paleti okur."
  - Key: Board Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Tahta Rengi
  - Key: Tile Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Zemin Rengi
  - Key: Wall Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Duvar Rengi
  - Key: Background
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Arka Plan
  - Key: Assign CD_JellyPalette to edit the jelly colours here.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le renklerini burada d\xFCzenlemek i\xE7in CD_JellyPalette ata."
  - Key: Backdrop
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Ekran Arka Plan\u0131"
  - Key: Ink
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yaz\u0131 Rengi"
  - Key: Muted
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Soluk Yaz\u0131 Rengi"
  - Key: Card Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Kart Rengi
  - Key: Button Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Buton Rengi
  - Key: Hud Accent
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Vurgu Rengi
  - Key: The coin icon and other gold touches in the HUD.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Aray\xFCzdeki para ikonu ve di\u011Fer alt\u0131n rengi dokunu\u015Flar."
  - Key: Map placement
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Haritan\u0131n yeri"
  - Key: Map Side Margin
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Harita Yan Bo\u015Flu\u011Fu"
  - Key: Space between the map and each side of the screen, as a share of the screen's
      width. The map is centred, so both sides always get the same space.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Harita ile ekran\u0131n her iki yan\u0131 aras\u0131ndaki bo\u015Fluk,
        ekran geni\u015Fli\u011Fine oranla. Harita ortalan\u0131r, iki yan her zaman
        e\u015Fit bo\u015Fluk al\u0131r."
  - Key: Map Top Space
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Harita \xDCst Bo\u015Flu\u011Fu"
  - Key: Room kept for the HUD above the map, in layout units (the screen is 760
      units wide).
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Haritan\u0131n \xFCst\xFCnde aray\xFCz i\xE7in ayr\u0131lan yer, yerle\u015Fim
        birimi cinsinden (ekran 760 birim geni\u015Fli\u011Finde)."
  - Key: Map Bottom Space
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Harita Alt Bo\u015Flu\u011Fu"
  - Key: Room kept for the restart button and the warning line below the map, in
      layout units. Lower moves the map down and lets it grow.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Haritan\u0131n alt\u0131nda yeniden ba\u015Flat butonu ve uyar\u0131
        sat\u0131r\u0131 i\xE7in ayr\u0131lan yer, yerle\u015Fim birimi cinsinden.
        D\xFC\u015F\xFCk de\u011Fer haritay\u0131 a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131 al\u0131r
        ve b\xFCy\xFCmesine izin verir."
  - Key: Timer
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\xFCre"
  - Key: Time Warning Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\xFCre Uyar\u0131 Rengi"
  - Key: Time Warning Seconds
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\xFCre Uyar\u0131 Saniyesi"
  - Key: The timer turns to the warning colour at this many seconds left.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu kadar saniye kal\u0131nca s\xFCre uyar\u0131 rengine d\xF6ner."
  - Key: Win and lose panels
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Kazanma ve kaybetme panelleri
  - Key: Panel Dim
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Panel Karartmas\u0131"
  - Key: Win Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Kazanma Rengi
  - Key: Win Panel Delay
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Kazanma Paneli Gecikmesi
  - Key: Seconds after the win before the panel shows, so the last jelly is seen
      leaving.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kazand\u0131ktan sonra panel gelmeden \xF6nce ge\xE7en saniye; son j\xF6lenin
        \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCls\xFCn diye."
  - Key: Lose Panel Delay
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Kaybetme Paneli Gecikmesi
  - Key: Frame - the wall round the board
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xC7er\xE7eve - tahtan\u0131n \xE7evresindeki duvar"
  - Key: Top
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xDCst"
  - Key: The straight wall along the top of the board.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n \xFCst\xFC boyunca d\xFCz duvar."
  - Key: Bottom
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Alt
  - Key: The straight wall along the bottom of the board.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n alt\u0131 boyunca d\xFCz duvar."
  - Key: Left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Sol
  - Key: The straight wall down the left of the board.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n solu boyunca d\xFCz duvar."
  - Key: Right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sa\u011F"
  - Key: The straight wall down the right of the board.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n sa\u011F\u0131 boyunca d\xFCz duvar."
  - Key: Corner Top Left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sol \xDCst K\xF6\u015Fe"
  - Key: Corner Top Right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sa\u011F \xDCst K\xF6\u015Fe"
  - Key: Corner Bottom Left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sol Alt K\xF6\u015Fe"
  - Key: Corner Bottom Right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sa\u011F Alt K\xF6\u015Fe"
  - Key: Walls on the board - picked by which neighbours are walls too
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtadaki duvarlar - hangi kom\u015Fular\u0131n da duvar oldu\u011Funa
        g\xF6re se\xE7ilir"
  - Key: Inner
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130\xE7 Duvar"
  - Key: Used for every piece below that is left empty.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da bo\u015F b\u0131rak\u0131lan her par\xE7a i\xE7in
        kullan\u0131l\u0131r."
  - Key: Single
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Tek
  - Key: A wall with no wall beside it.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yan\u0131nda ba\u015Fka duvar olmayan duvar."
  - Key: End Up
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "U\xE7 (Yukar\u0131)"
  - Key: The end of a line of walls that carries on upward.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yukar\u0131 do\u011Fru devam eden duvar s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131n ucu."
  - Key: End Down
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "U\xE7 (A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131)"
  - Key: The end of a line of walls that carries on downward.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131 do\u011Fru devam eden duvar s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131n
        ucu."
  - Key: End Left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "U\xE7 (Sol)"
  - Key: The end of a line of walls that carries on to the left.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sola do\u011Fru devam eden duvar s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131n ucu."
  - Key: End Right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "U\xE7 (Sa\u011F)"
  - Key: The end of a line of walls that carries on to the right.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sa\u011Fa do\u011Fru devam eden duvar s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131n ucu."
  - Key: Horizontal
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Yatay
    - Code: en
      Text: Horizontal
  - Key: The middle of a line of walls from left to right.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Soldan sa\u011Fa duvar s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131n ortas\u0131."
  - Key: Vertical
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Dikey
    - Code: en
      Text: Vertical
  - Key: The middle of a line of walls from top to bottom.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yukar\u0131dan a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131ya duvar s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131n
        ortas\u0131."
  - Key: Corner Up Right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xF6\u015Fe (Yukar\u0131-Sa\u011F)"
  - Key: A corner joining the wall above and the wall to the right.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yukar\u0131daki duvarla sa\u011Fdaki duvar\u0131 birle\u015Ftiren k\xF6\u015Fe."
  - Key: Corner Up Left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xF6\u015Fe (Yukar\u0131-Sol)"
  - Key: A corner joining the wall above and the wall to the left.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yukar\u0131daki duvarla soldaki duvar\u0131 birle\u015Ftiren k\xF6\u015Fe."
  - Key: Corner Down Right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xF6\u015Fe (A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131-Sa\u011F)"
  - Key: A corner joining the wall below and the wall to the right.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki duvarla sa\u011Fdaki duvar\u0131 birle\u015Ftiren
        k\xF6\u015Fe."
  - Key: Corner Down Left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xF6\u015Fe (A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131-Sol)"
  - Key: A corner joining the wall below and the wall to the left.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki duvarla soldaki duvar\u0131 birle\u015Ftiren
        k\xF6\u015Fe."
  - Key: Tee Up
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "T (Yukar\u0131)"
  - Key: Walls to the left, right and above.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Solda, sa\u011Fda ve yukar\u0131da duvar."
  - Key: Tee Down
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "T (A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131)"
  - Key: Walls to the left, right and below.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Solda, sa\u011Fda ve a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da duvar."
  - Key: Tee Left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: T (Sol)
  - Key: Walls above, below and to the left.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yukar\u0131da, a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da ve solda duvar."
  - Key: Tee Right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "T (Sa\u011F)"
  - Key: Walls above, below and to the right.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yukar\u0131da, a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da ve sa\u011Fda duvar."
  - Key: Cross
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Art\u0131"
  - Key: Walls on all four sides.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "D\xF6rt yanda da duvar."
  - Key: Doors - element 0 is the 1x door, 3 the 4x one
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131lar - 0. eleman 1x kap\u0131, 3. eleman 4x kap\u0131"
  - Key: Door Inset
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131 \u0130\xE7e \xC7ekme"
  - Key: How far the door is pulled in from the board's edge cell onto the wall,
      in cells. The wall runs on under it.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131n\u0131n tahtan\u0131n kenar h\xFCcresinden duvar\u0131n \xFCst\xFCne
        ne kadar i\xE7eri \xE7ekildi\u011Fi, h\xFCcre cinsinden. Duvar alt\u0131ndan
        devam eder."
  - Key: Door Thickness
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131 Kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
  - Key: The door's size across the wall, in cells. Make it cover the wall under
      it.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131n\u0131n duvara dik boyutu, h\xFCcre cinsinden. Alt\u0131ndaki
        duvar\u0131 \xF6rtecek kadar olmal\u0131."
  - Key: Door Overhang
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131 Ta\u015Fmas\u0131"
  - Key: How far the door reaches past its cells at each end, in cells, so no wall
      shows at its ends.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131n\u0131n iki ucundan h\xFCcrelerinin ne kadar \xF6tesine ta\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131,
        h\xFCcre cinsinden; u\xE7larda duvar g\xF6r\xFCnmesin diye."
  - Key: Door Top
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xDCst Kap\u0131lar"
  - Key: Doors in the top wall. An empty slot uses the generated door, tinted with
      the jelly it waits for.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xDCst duvardaki kap\u0131lar. Bo\u015F slot, bekledi\u011Fi j\xF6lenin
        renginde \xFCretilmi\u015F kap\u0131y\u0131 kullan\u0131r."
  - Key: Door Bottom
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Alt Kap\u0131lar"
  - Key: Door Left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sol Kap\u0131lar"
  - Key: Door Right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sa\u011F Kap\u0131lar"
  - Key: Placement
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yerle\u015Fim"
  - Key: Piece Size
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Par\xE7a Boyutu"
  - Key: Size of a painted wall piece, in cells. Above 1 lets pieces overlap so the
      joins do not show.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xC7izilmi\u015F duvar par\xE7as\u0131n\u0131n boyutu, h\xFCcre cinsinden.
        1'in \xFCst\xFC par\xE7alar\u0131 hafif\xE7e \xFCst \xFCste bindirir, ekler
        g\xF6r\xFCnmez."
  - Key: Piece Offset
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Par\xE7a Kaymas\u0131"
  - Key: Moves painted wall pieces and doors off their cells, in cells (x right,
      y up).
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xC7izilmi\u015F duvar par\xE7alar\u0131n\u0131 ve kap\u0131lar\u0131
        h\xFCcrelerinden kayd\u0131r\u0131r, h\xFCcre cinsinden (x sa\u011Fa, y yukar\u0131)."
  - Key: Frame Inset
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xC7er\xE7eve \u0130\xE7e \xC7ekme"
  - Key: Moves the painted wall round the board toward the middle, in cells; corners
      move both ways. Near 1 sets a wall painted on the outer edge of its square
      against the floor.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n \xE7evresindeki \xE7izilmi\u015F duvar\u0131 ortaya do\u011Fru
        \xE7eker, h\xFCcre cinsinden; k\xF6\u015Feler iki y\xF6nde kayar. 1'e yak\u0131n
        de\u011Fer, karesinin d\u0131\u015F kenar\u0131na \xE7izilmi\u015F duvar\u0131
        zemine yaslar."
  - Key: Icon Size
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130kon Boyutu"
  - Key: Size of the jelly drawn on a door, as a share of the door's size.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst\xFCnde \xE7izilen j\xF6lenin boyutu, kap\u0131n\u0131n
        boyutuna oranla."
  - Key: Icon Offset
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130kon Kaymas\u0131"
  - Key: Moves the jelly drawn on a door, in cells.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst\xFCnde \xE7izilen j\xF6leyi kayd\u0131r\u0131r,
        h\xFCcre cinsinden."
  - Key: Counter Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Saya\xE7 Rengi"
  - Key: How many more jellies a door takes, shown as +N at its corner.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131n\u0131n daha ka\xE7 j\xF6le alaca\u011F\u0131; k\xF6\u015Fesinde
        +N olarak g\xF6sterilir."
  - Key: Counter Badge
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Saya\xE7 Arka Plan\u0131"
  - Key: Counter Size
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Saya\xE7 Boyutu"
  - Key: Counter Offset
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Saya\xE7 Kaymas\u0131"
  - Key: Where the +N badge sits, from the door's top-right corner, in cells.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "+N rozetinin kap\u0131n\u0131n sa\u011F \xFCst k\xF6\u015Fesine g\xF6re
        yeri, h\xFCcre cinsinden."
  - Key: The walls and doors of the board. Changes preview immediately in Play Mode.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n duvarlar\u0131 ve kap\u0131lar\u0131. De\u011Fi\u015Fiklikler
        Play Mode'da an\u0131nda g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
  - Key: Feel
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: His
  - Key: Look
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "G\xF6r\xFCn\xFC\u015F"
  - Key: Hud
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Aray\xFCz"
  - Key: How the jellies move and react
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6lelerin nas\u0131l hareket edip tepki verdi\u011Fi"
  - Key: 'How the board looks: art, shading, colours, walls'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n g\xF6r\xFCn\xFC\u015F\xFC: g\xF6rseller, g\xF6lgeler,
        renkler, duvarlar"
  - Key: The screen around the board
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n \xE7evresindeki ekran"
  - Key: Each part is an asset of its own. Edit it here or open it on its own; changes
      preview immediately in Play Mode.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Her b\xF6l\xFCm ayr\u0131 bir asset. Burada ya da kendi ba\u015F\u0131na
        a\xE7arak d\xFCzenle; de\u011Fi\u015Fiklikler Play Mode'da an\u0131nda g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
  - Key: 'Assign a {0} asset: the screen does not open without it.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bir {0} asset'i ata: ekran onsuz a\xE7\u0131lmaz."
  - Key: Refresh preview
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xD6nizlemeyi yenile"
  - Key: "JELLY \u2022 LEVELS"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xD6LE \u2022 LEVELLER"
  - Key: The order is the level number. Press Open to edit a level.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\u0131ra level numaras\u0131d\u0131r. Bir level'i d\xFCzenlemek i\xE7in
        A\xE7'a bas."
  - Key: Start level
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 level'i"
  - Key: (empty row)
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "(bo\u015F sat\u0131r)"
  - Key: This level has errors; open it and read the warnings.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu level'de hata var; a\xE7 ve uyar\u0131lar\u0131 oku."
  - Key: "\u25B6 start"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u25B6 ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7"
  - Key: Open
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\xE7"
  - Key: 'Copy: the copy goes right after it'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kopyala: kopya hemen arkas\u0131na gelir"
  - Key: Remove from the list (the file is kept)
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Listeden \xE7\u0131kar (dosya silinmez)"
  - Key: + Add new level
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: + Yeni level ekle
  - Key: Add an existing level
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Var olan bir level ekle
  - Key: 'Advanced: raw list'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Geli\u015Fmi\u015F: ham liste"
  - Key: No CD_JellyLevels asset found. Create one with Create > Jelly Fuse > Level
      List.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "CD_JellyLevels asset'i bulunamad\u0131. Create > Jelly Fuse > Level
        List ile olu\u015Ftur."
  - Key: Pick a level on the left, or add a new one.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Soldan bir level se\xE7 ya da yeni bir tane ekle."
  - Key: "JELLY \u2022 LEVEL DESIGNER"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xD6LE \u2022 LEVEL TASARIMCISI"
  - Key: "Level settings: {0}  |  {1} \xD7 {2}  |  {3} s"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Level ayarlar\u0131: {0}  |  {1} \xD7 {2}  |  {3} sn"
  - Key: Level name
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Level ad\u0131"
  - Key: Hint
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130pucu"
  - Key: Width
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Geni\u015Flik"
  - Key: Height
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Y\xFCkseklik"
  - Key: Time (s)
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\xFCre (sn)"
  - Key: This level still has exits from before doors. The game turns them into doors
      as it loads; convert them here to edit them as doors.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu level'de kap\u0131lardan \xF6nceki eski \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Flar
        var. Oyun y\xFCklerken onlar\u0131 kap\u0131ya \xE7evirir; kap\u0131 olarak
        d\xFCzenlemek i\xE7in burada \xE7evir."
  - Key: Convert old exits to doors
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Eski \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Flar\u0131 kap\u0131ya \xE7evir"
  - Key: Jelly
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le"
  - Key: Door
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131"
  - Key: Wall
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Duvar
  - Key: Empty
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bo\u015F"
  - Key: Erase
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Sil
  - Key: 'Click empty floor: place a jelly.  Click a jelly: select.  Drag: move.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bo\u015F zemine t\u0131kla: j\xF6le koy.  J\xF6leye t\u0131kla: se\xE7. 
        S\xFCr\xFCkle: ta\u015F\u0131."
  - Key: 'Click the wall round the board (its outermost cells): place a door.  Click
      a door: select it, then set the jellies it takes below the board.  Drag: move.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtan\u0131n \xE7evresindeki duvara (en d\u0131\u015F h\xFCcrelere)
        t\u0131kla: kap\u0131 koy.  Kap\u0131ya t\u0131kla: se\xE7, sonra alaca\u011F\u0131
        j\xF6leleri tahtan\u0131n alt\u0131nda ayarla.  S\xFCr\xFCkle: ta\u015F\u0131."
  - Key: Drag to paint walls.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Duvar boyamak i\xE7in s\xFCr\xFCkle."
  - Key: 'Drag to paint empty cells: no floor, nothing can pass.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bo\u015F h\xFCcre boyamak i\xE7in s\xFCr\xFCkle: zemin yok, hi\xE7bir
        \u015Fey ge\xE7emez."
  - Key: 'Click or drag: delete what is underneath.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "T\u0131kla ya da s\xFCr\xFCkle: alt\u0131ndakini sil."
  - Key: Right-click deletes with any tool.  Esc deselects.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sa\u011F t\u0131k her ara\xE7la siler.  Esc se\xE7imi kald\u0131r\u0131r."
  - Key: No CD_JellyPalette found. Create one and set it on CD_JellyLevels.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "CD_JellyPalette bulunamad\u0131. Bir tane olu\u015Ftur ve CD_JellyLevels'a
        ata."
  - Key: Colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Renk
  - Key: Shape
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u015Eekil"
  - Key: Rotate
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "D\xF6nd\xFCr"
  - Key: Two
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u0130kili"
  - Key: Three
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xDC\xE7l\xFC"
  - Key: Four
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "D\xF6rtl\xFC"
  - Key: Square
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Kare
  - Key: Small L
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xFC\xE7\xFCk L"
  - Key: Small J
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xFC\xE7\xFCk J"
  - Key: That jelly is wider than the door, so it cannot pass. Make the door wider.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu j\xF6le kap\u0131dan geni\u015F, ge\xE7emez. Kap\u0131y\u0131 geni\u015Flet."
  - Key: That shape does not fit here. Move it or make room first.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu \u015Fekil buraya s\u0131\u011Fm\u0131yor. \xD6nce ta\u015F\u0131
        ya da yer a\xE7."
  - Key: A door that wide does not fit there.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "O geni\u015Flikte bir kap\u0131 oraya s\u0131\u011Fm\u0131yor."
  - Key: Extra colours
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Ek renkler
  - Key: Colours only this level uses. The shared ones are in CD_JellyPalette.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yaln\u0131zca bu level'in kulland\u0131\u011F\u0131 renkler. Ortak olanlar
        CD_JellyPalette'te."
  - Key: Delete
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Sil
  - Key: Recolour what uses it first.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xD6nce onu kullananlar\u0131n rengini de\u011Fi\u015Ftir."
  - Key: + Add colour
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: + Renk ekle
  - Key: "Selected jelly \xB7 {0} \xB7 {1} cells"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Se\xE7ili j\xF6le \xB7 {0} \xB7 {1} h\xFCcre"
  - Key: Name
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Ad
  - Key: Delete this jelly
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu j\xF6leyi sil"
  - Key: "Selected door {0} \xB7 {1} \xB7 {2}x"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Se\xE7ili kap\u0131 {0} \xB7 {1} \xB7 {2}x"
  - Key: bottom
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: alt
  - Key: top
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xFCst"
  - Key: left
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: sol
  - Key: right
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "sa\u011F"
  - Key: 'The jellies it takes, in order: when one passes, the next is waited for.
      Select one to set its colour and shape above.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Ald\u0131\u011F\u0131 j\xF6leler, s\u0131ras\u0131yla: biri ge\xE7ince
        s\u0131radaki beklenir. Rengini ve \u015Feklini yukar\u0131dan ayarlamak
        i\xE7in birini se\xE7."
  - Key: + Add next jelly
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "+ S\u0131radaki j\xF6leyi ekle"
  - Key: The door takes it after the last one. It starts as a copy of the selected
      jelly.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131 onu sonuncudan sonra al\u0131r. Se\xE7ili j\xF6lenin kopyas\u0131
        olarak ba\u015Flar."
  - Key: "\u2190 Earlier"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u2190 \xD6nce"
  - Key: "Later \u2192"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sonra \u2192"
  - Key: Remove this jelly
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu j\xF6leyi \xE7\u0131kar"
  - Key: Delete door
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131y\u0131 sil"
  - Key: Cell size
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "H\xFCcre boyutu"
  - Key: How big each cell of the map is drawn.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Haritan\u0131n her h\xFCcresinin ne kadar b\xFCy\xFCk \xE7izildi\u011Fi."
  - Key: Fit
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\u0131\u011Fd\u0131r"
  - Key: Size the cells so the whole map fits the view.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "H\xFCcreleri, haritan\u0131n tamam\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCme s\u0131\u011Facak
        \u015Fekilde boyutland\u0131r."
  - Key: It does not fit there.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Oraya s\u0131\u011Fm\u0131yor."
  - Key: A corner cannot hold a door.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "K\xF6\u015Feye kap\u0131 konamaz."
  - Key: 'Doors go in the wall round the board: its outermost cells.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131lar tahtan\u0131n \xE7evresindeki duvara, yani en d\u0131\u015F
        h\xFCcrelere konur."
  - Key: The jelly must fit on empty floor, inside the wall round the board.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6le, tahtan\u0131n \xE7evresindeki duvar\u0131n i\xE7inde bo\u015F
        zemine s\u0131\u011Fmal\u0131."
  - Key: A door must fit on its side, clear of other doors, with no wall or empty
      cell in front of it.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131 kendi kenar\u0131na s\u0131\u011Fmal\u0131, ba\u015Fka kap\u0131larla
        \xE7ak\u0131\u015Fmamal\u0131 ve \xF6n\xFCnde duvar ya da bo\u015F h\xFCcre
        olmamal\u0131."
  - Key: Cannot paint over a jelly.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6lenin \xFCst\xFCne boyanamaz."
  - Key: 'Balance: each colour''s jelly cells must equal the cells its doors take'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Denge: her rengin j\xF6le h\xFCcreleri, kap\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n alaca\u011F\u0131
        h\xFCcrelere e\u015Fit olmal\u0131"
  - Key: "\u2192 {0} jelly cells missing"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u2192 {0} j\xF6le h\xFCcresi eksik"
  - Key: "\u2192 {0} extra jelly cells"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u2192 {0} j\xF6le h\xFCcresi fazla"
  - Key: '{0}:  {1} jelly / {2} at doors   {3}'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}:  {1} j\xF6le / {2} kap\u0131larda   {3}"
  - Key: Level is valid. Test solvability in Play Mode.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Level ge\xE7erli. \xC7\xF6z\xFClebilirli\u011Fi Play Mode'da dene."
  - Key: 'In the level list: {0} / {1}'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: 'Level listesinde: {0} / {1}'
  - Key: Not in the level list, so the game never opens it.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Level listesinde de\u011Fil, oyun onu hi\xE7 a\xE7maz."
  - Key: Add to the end of the list
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Listenin sonuna ekle
  - Key: Open list
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Listeyi a\xE7"
  - Key: Save
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Kaydet
  - Key: Duplicate as new level
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Yeni level olarak kopyala
  - Key: The copy is added to the level list right after this level.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kopya, level listesinde bu level'in hemen arkas\u0131na eklenir."
  - Key: Press Restart in Play Mode to load edits. Ctrl+Z undoes.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "D\xFCzenlemeleri y\xFCklemek i\xE7in Play Mode'da Yeniden Ba\u015Flat'a
        bas. Ctrl+Z geri al\u0131r."
  - Key: 'Advanced: raw data'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Geli\u015Fmi\u015F: ham veri"
  - Key: Walls
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: Duvarlar
  - Key: Holes
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bo\u015F h\xFCcreler"
  - Key: Shapes
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u015Eekiller"
  - Key: Doors
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131lar"
  - Key: T
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: 
  - Key: S
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: 
  - Key: Z
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: 
  - Key: L
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: 
  - Key: J
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: 
  - Key: Outside area
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "D\u0131\u015F alan"
  - Key: How many cells round the board the map shows.
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Haritan\u0131n tahtan\u0131n \xE7evresinde ka\xE7 h\xFCcre g\xF6sterdi\u011Fi."
  - Key: Fit to jelly
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Fit to jelly
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6leye g\xF6re daralt"
  - Key: 'On: for each jelly the door opens only as wide as that jelly, from its
      first cell, and the rest of it is wall. Off: it stays open across its whole
      size.'
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: 'On: for each jelly the door opens only as wide as that jelly, from its
        first cell, and the rest of it is wall. Off: it stays open across its whole
        size.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\xE7\u0131k: kap\u0131 her j\xF6le i\xE7in yaln\u0131zca o j\xF6le
        kadar, ilk h\xFCcresinden ba\u015Flayarak a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r; kalan\u0131
        duvar olur. Kapal\u0131: kap\u0131 t\xFCm boyunca a\xE7\u0131k kal\u0131r."
  - Key: Pull reach
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Pull reach
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xC7ekme mesafesi"
  - Key: 'A jelly this door waits for, let go of in its rows (or columns) with up
      to this many free cells between it and the door, is drawn the rest of the way
      in. 0: it has to be put right in front of the door.'
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: 'A jelly this door waits for, let go of in its rows (or columns) with
        up to this many free cells between it and the door, is drawn the rest of
        the way in. 0: it has to be put right in front of the door.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131n\u0131n bekledi\u011Fi j\xF6le, kap\u0131n\u0131n sat\u0131rlar\u0131nda
        (ya da s\xFCtunlar\u0131nda) b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda kap\u0131yla
        aras\u0131nda en fazla bu kadar bo\u015F h\xFCcre varsa kap\u0131ya \xE7ekilir.
        0: j\xF6le tam kap\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n\xFCne konmal\u0131d\u0131r."
  - Key: Own pull reach
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Own pull reach
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kendi \xE7ekme mesafesi"
  - Key: 'Off: the door uses Default Pull Reach from the level list. On: it uses
      its own, set below.'
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: 'Off: the door uses Default Pull Reach from the level list. On: it uses
        its own, set below.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kapal\u0131: kap\u0131, b\xF6l\xFCm listesindeki varsay\u0131lan \xE7ekme
        mesafesini kullan\u0131r. A\xE7\u0131k: a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da ayarlanan
        kendi de\u011Ferini kullan\u0131r."
  - Key: Frozen
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Frozen
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Donmu\u015F"
  - Key: Thaws after
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Thaws after
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFClme say\u0131s\u0131"
  - Key: How many jellies must go through doors, anywhere on the board, before it
      thaws.
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: How many jellies must go through doors, anywhere on the board, before
        it thaws.
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFClmesi i\xE7in tahtan\u0131n herhangi bir yerinde ka\xE7
        j\xF6lenin kap\u0131lardan ge\xE7mesi gerekti\u011Fi."
  - Key: 'Frozen: the jelly cannot be moved or fused until this many jellies have
      gone through doors.'
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: 'Frozen: the jelly cannot be moved or fused until this many jellies have
        gone through doors.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Donmu\u015F: bu kadar j\xF6le kap\u0131lardan ge\xE7ene kadar j\xF6le
        hareket ettirilemez ve birle\u015Fmez."
  - Key: 'Frozen: the door takes nothing, and stands like wall, until this many jellies
      have gone through the other doors.'
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: 'Frozen: the door takes nothing, and stands like wall, until this many
        jellies have gone through the other doors.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Donmu\u015F: bu kadar j\xF6le di\u011Fer kap\u0131lardan ge\xE7ene kadar
        kap\u0131 hi\xE7bir \u015Fey almaz ve duvar gibi durur."
  - Key: Arrow block
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Arrow block
    - Code: tr
      Text: Ok blok
  - Key: 'On: the jelly moves only one way, set below.'
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: 'On: the jelly moves only one way, set below.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "A\xE7\u0131k: j\xF6le sadece a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da se\xE7ilen y\xF6nde
        hareket eder."
  - Key: Moves
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Moves
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Hareket y\xF6n\xFC"
  - Key: The one way the jelly can move.
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: The one way the jelly can move.
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6lenin hareket edebilece\u011Fi tek y\xF6n."
  - Key: Free arrows after fusion
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Free arrows after fusion
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Birle\u015Fmeden sonra oklar\u0131 kald\u0131r"
  - Key: 'Tutorial'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u00D6\u011Fretici"
  - Key: 'Click a cell of the jelly to lead, then the cells to lead it through, in order; the last one is where it is let go of (a door cell sends it out). Right-click takes back the last cell.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Y\u00F6nlendirilecek j\u00F6lenin bir h\u00FCcresine, sonra s\u0131rayla ge\u00E7ece\u011Fi h\u00FCcrelere t\u0131kla; sonuncusu b\u0131rak\u0131laca\u011F\u0131 yer (kap\u0131 h\u00FCcresi j\u00F6leyi d\u0131\u015Far\u0131 g\u00F6nderir). Sa\u011F t\u0131k son h\u00FCcreyi geri al\u0131r."
  - Key: 'Tutorial steps'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u00D6\u011Fretici ad\u0131mlar\u0131"
  - Key: 'No tutorial. Add a step, then click on the map.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u00D6\u011Fretici yok. Bir ad\u0131m ekle, sonra haritaya t\u0131kla."
  - Key: 'Step {0}: {1} cells'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Ad\u0131m {0}: {1} h\u00FCcre"
  - Key: 'Clear'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Temizle"
  - Key: '+ Add step'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "+ Ad\u0131m ekle"
  - Key: 'The first cell of a step is on the jelly to lead.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Ad\u0131m\u0131n ilk h\u00FCcresi y\u00F6nlendirilecek j\u00F6lenin \u00FCst\u00FCnde olmal\u0131."
  - Key: 'Text key'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yaz\u0131 anahtar\u0131"
  - Key: 'The localization key of the text shown during this step. Empty: no text.'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu ad\u0131m s\u0131ras\u0131nda g\u00F6sterilen yaz\u0131n\u0131n \u00E7eviri anahtar\u0131. Bo\u015F: yaz\u0131 yok."
  - Key: 'Text (English)'
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yaz\u0131 (\u0130ngilizce)"
  - Key: "The board must be 3 to 20 cells wide and tall."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahta en az 3, en fazla 20 h\u00FCcre geni\u015Fli\u011Finde ve y\u00FCksekli\u011Finde olmal\u0131."
  - Key: "The time limit must be more than 0 seconds."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\u00FCre 0 saniyeden fazla olmal\u0131."
  - Key: "There is no jelly on the board. Place at least one."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Tahtada hi\u00E7 j\u00F6le yok. En az bir tane koy."
  - Key: "There is no door. Place at least one in the wall round the board."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Hi\u00E7 kap\u0131 yok. Tahtan\u0131n \u00E7evresindeki duvara en az bir kap\u0131 koy."
  - Key: "An extra colour has no name, or two extra colours share an ID."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Ek renklerden birinin ad\u0131 yok ya da iki ek renk ayn\u0131 numaray\u0131 kullan\u0131yor."
  - Key: "Colour number {0} is used but not defined. Pick another colour for its jellies."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0} numaral\u0131 renk kullan\u0131lm\u0131\u015F ama tan\u0131ml\u0131 de\u011Fil. O j\u00F6leler i\u00E7in ba\u015Fka bir renk se\u00E7."
  - Key: "A wall or empty cell at {0} is off the board or painted twice. Erase it."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0} konumundaki duvar ya da bo\u015F h\u00FCcre tahtan\u0131n d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda ya da iki kez boyanm\u0131\u015F. Sil."
  - Key: "{0}: its cells are not all joined side by side. Every jelly must be one piece."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: h\u00FCcreleri yan yana ba\u011Fl\u0131 de\u011Fil. Her j\u00F6le tek par\u00E7a olmal\u0131."
  - Key: "{0}: it sits in the wall round the board. Move it inside."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: tahtan\u0131n \u00E7evresindeki duvar\u0131n \u00FCst\u00FCnde duruyor. \u0130\u00E7eri ta\u015F\u0131."
  - Key: "{0}: cell {1} is off the board or already taken by a wall or another jelly."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: {1} h\u00FCcresi tahtan\u0131n d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda ya da orada zaten duvar veya ba\u015Fka bir j\u00F6le var."
  - Key: "{0}: a door is 1 to {1} cells wide."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: kap\u0131 1 ile {1} h\u00FCcre aras\u0131 geni\u015Flikte olmal\u0131."
  - Key: "{0}: it runs into a corner. Move it along its side."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: k\u00F6\u015Feye ta\u015F\u0131yor. Kenar\u0131 boyunca kayd\u0131r."
  - Key: "{0}: it overlaps another door on the same side. Move one of them."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: ayn\u0131 kenardaki ba\u015Fka bir kap\u0131yla \u00FCst \u00FCste. Birini kayd\u0131r."
  - Key: "{0}: a wall stands in the door at {1}. Erase the wall or move the door."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: kap\u0131n\u0131n {1} h\u00FCcresinde duvar var. Duvar\u0131 sil ya da kap\u0131y\u0131 kayd\u0131r."
  - Key: "{0}: an empty cell is in the door at {1}. Erase it or move the door."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: kap\u0131n\u0131n {1} h\u00FCcresi bo\u015F h\u00FCcre. Bo\u015F h\u00FCcreyi sil ya da kap\u0131y\u0131 kayd\u0131r."
  - Key: "{0}: it waits for no jelly. Add one to its queue."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: hi\u00E7 j\u00F6le beklemiyor. Kuyru\u011Funa bir j\u00F6le ekle."
  - Key: "{0}: {1} in its queue is not one joined piece."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: kuyru\u011Fundaki {1} tek par\u00E7a de\u011Fil, h\u00FCcreleri ba\u011Fl\u0131 olmal\u0131."
  - Key: "{0}: {1} in its queue is {2} cells wide and cannot pass a {3}-wide door. Widen the door."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: kuyru\u011Fundaki {1} {2} h\u00FCcre geni\u015Fli\u011Finde, {3} h\u00FCcrelik kap\u0131dan ge\u00E7emez. Kap\u0131y\u0131 geni\u015Flet."
  - Key: "{0}: the jellies on the board have {1} cells, but its doors take {2}. Every cell must leave by a door."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "{0}: tahtadaki j\u00F6leler {1} h\u00FCcre, kap\u0131lar ise {2} h\u00FCcre al\u0131yor. Her h\u00FCcre bir kap\u0131dan \u00E7\u0131kmal\u0131."
  - Key: "A door must fit on its side between the corners, clear of other doors, with no empty cell in front of it."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Kap\u0131 k\u00F6\u015Felere ta\u015Fmadan kenar\u0131na s\u0131\u011Fmal\u0131, ba\u015Fka kap\u0131larla \u00E7ak\u0131\u015Fmamal\u0131 ve \u00F6n\u00FCnde bo\u015F h\u00FCcre olmamal\u0131."
  - Key: "Localization table"
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yerelle\u015Ftirme tablosu"
  - Key: "The table the pages' texts are written to. The game reads them by key from every table."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sayfalar\u0131n yaz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n yaz\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131 tablo. Oyun onlar\u0131 anahtarla b\u00FCt\u00FCn tablolardan okur."
  - Key: "Pick a Game table to write the texts in every language."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yaz\u0131lar\u0131 her dilde girmek i\u00E7in bir Game tablosu se\u00E7."
  - Key: "This is an Editor table: the game does not read it. Pick a Game table."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bu bir Editor tablosu, oyun bunu okumaz. Bir Game tablosu se\u00E7."
  - Key: "No CD_Localization in the project: only the English is edited."
    Translations:
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Projede CD_Localization yok: sadece \u0130ngilizce d\u00FCzenlenir."
